{"title":"AoPS Wiki:Community portal","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>For discussion related to the AoPS Wiki, please see <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Discussion\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Discussion\">AoPS Wiki:Discussion</a> or the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/community/c65\">AoPS Wiki Forum</a> in the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/community\">AoPS community</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<center style=\"background-color:#CADCEB; border:1px solid #98AAB1; padding:8px; margin-bottom:8px;\"><big><b>Community Portal</b></big></center>\n<table style=\"border:1px solid #999; background: #fff; margin: .3em .3em .3em 1em; padding: 3px; float:right\"><tbody><tr><td>\n<span id=\"shortcut\"><b>Shortcut</b>:<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:CP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:CP\">A:CP</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:PORT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:PORT\">A:PORT</a></div>\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Welcome to our <b>community portal</b>. This is the page to <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Tutorial\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Tutorial\">learn</a> about using and editing the AoPS Wiki, discover what is currently ongoing on the AoPS Wiki, and view important <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Policy\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Policy\">guidelines and policies</a> that editors should abide by.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding-left:10px;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\">About</span></h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<dl><dd><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:About\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:About\">AoPS Wiki:About</a></i></dd></dl>\n<p>What makes <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a> different from other math-related wikis and web resources is that the AoPS Wiki is more involved in problem-solving techniques than most other math dictionaries or math encyclopedias (which are usually written on the level of professional <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematician\" title=\"Mathematician\">mathematicians</a>). \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding-left:10px;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_Started\">Getting Started</span></h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<dl><dd><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Tutorial\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Tutorial\">AoPS Wiki:Tutorial</a></i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Tutorial\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Tutorial\">AoPS Wiki tutorial</a> contains basic information about editing the wiki, including general syntax help.</li>\n<li>To begin uploading and adding solutions to contest problems, take a look at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Contest_Problem_Standards\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Contest Problem Standards\">AoPS Wiki:Contest Problem Standards</a>.</li>\n<li>Different namespaces include the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Talk&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Help:Talk (page does not exist)\">talk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Template\" title=\"Help:Template\">template</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Category\" title=\"Help:Category\">category</a> namespaces. Each serves to a different purpose.</li>\n<li>Learn <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:What_AoPS_Wiki_is_not\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:What AoPS Wiki is not\">what AoPS Wiki is not</a> a place for.</li>\n<li>For other information regarding wikis, see the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Help:Contents\">MediaWiki help contents</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>Feel free to start testing your newly acquired wiki editing skills in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Sandbox\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Sandbox\">AoPS Wiki Sandbox</a>!\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding-left:10px;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Help_Out\">Help Out</span></h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<dl><dd><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Site_Support\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Site Support\">AoPS Wiki:Site Support</a></i></dd></dl>\n<p>As a fairly new wiki, the AoPS Wiki needs the help of many contributors. Here are some ways to help <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Site_Support\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Site Support\">improve the quality</a> of the AoPS Wiki.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Create an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WantedPages\" title=\"Special:WantedPages\">non-existent article</a>.</li>\n<li>Edit existing articles to fix errors (both grammatical and mistakes) or to add more information.</li>\n<li>De-<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Stub\" title=\"Template:Stub\">stub</a> an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Stubs\" title=\"Category:Stubs\">article</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:Upload\" title=\"Special:Upload\">Upload</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Image_needed\" title=\"Category:Image needed\">relevant images</a> to the AoPS Wiki.</li>\n<li>Add solutions to problems that <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Problems_with_no_solution\" title=\"Category:Problems with no solution\">lack them</a>.</li>\n<li>Suggest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Spam\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Spam\">spamming</a> and advertising articles for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Delete\" title=\"Template:Delete\">deletion</a>.</li>\n<li>Spread the word about the AoPS Wiki.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding-left:10px;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requests\">Requests</span></h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<ul><li><b>Creation</b>: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logical_notation&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Logical notation (page does not exist)\">Logical notation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Thermal_energy&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Thermal energy (page does not exist)\">Thermal energy</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Measure_theory&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Measure theory (page does not exist)\">Measure theory</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Path&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Path (page does not exist)\">Path</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sorting&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sorting (page does not exist)\">Sorting</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WantedPages\" title=\"Special:WantedPages\"><i>more</i>...</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Stubs</b> <i>(996)</i>: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology\" title=\"Biology\">Biology</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Kernel\" title=\"Kernel\">Kernel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic\" title=\"Logic\">Logic</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Field_theory\" title=\"Field theory\">Field theory</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Group_theory\" title=\"Group theory\">Group theory</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ring_theory\" title=\"Ring theory\">Ring theory</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set_theory\" title=\"Set theory\">Set theory</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Thermodynamics\" title=\"Thermodynamics\">Thermodynamics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Weight\" title=\"Weight\">Weight</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Stubs\" title=\"Category:Stubs\"><i>more</i>...</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Image requests</b> <i>(394)</i>: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Boolean_lattice\" title=\"Boolean lattice\">Boolean lattice</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Conic_section\" title=\"Conic section\">Conic section</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Directed_graph\" title=\"Directed graph\">Directed graph</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sorgenfrey_plane\" title=\"Sorgenfrey plane\">Sorgenfrey plane</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Image_needed\" title=\"Category:Image needed\"><i>more</i>...</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Edit protected pages</b> <i>(25)</i>: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Tutorial\" title=\"Template:Tutorial\">Template:Tutorial</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Edit-protected\" title=\"Template:Edit-protected\">Template:Edit-protected</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Rusczyk\" title=\"Richard Rusczyk\">Richard Rusczyk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Stub\" title=\"Template:Stub\">Template:Stub</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Requested_edits\" title=\"Category:Requested edits\"><i>more</i>...</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Empty</b> <i>(17)</i>: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=3D_Rendering_Mechanics\" title=\"3D Rendering Mechanics\">3D Rendering Mechanics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Brianchon%27s_Theorem\" title=\"Brianchon&#39;s Theorem\">Brianchon's Theorem</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pick%27s_Theorem\" title=\"Pick&#39;s Theorem\">Pick's Theorem</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Empty_template_page\" title=\"Category:Empty template page\"><i>more</i>...</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Deletion</b> <i>(22)</i>: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Articles_for_deletion\" title=\"Category:Articles for deletion\"><i>more</i>...</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>Note: It would be appreciated if you would correct and update this list if the listed articles no longer belong in the section.</i>\n</p><p>(<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Requests&amp;action=edit\">Update</a>)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding-left:10px;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dirty_Work\">Dirty Work</span></h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<p>If you're really patient, you can do some of the boring work on the wiki:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Add the templates <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Main\" title=\"Template:Main\">Template:Main</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Image\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Template:Image\">Template:Image</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Stub\" title=\"Template:Stub\">Template:Stub</a> to lacking articles.</li>\n<li>Move the articles in the <tt>AoPS Wiki:</tt> namespace that are tutorials to the <tt>Help:</tt> namespace.</li>\n<li>Transfer AMC/AIME/USAMO/IMO problems onto the wiki.</li>\n<li>Put articles into categories. Here are some of the most lacking categories:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:3D-Geometry\" title=\"Category:3D-Geometry\">Category:3D-Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Complex_Number_Problems\" title=\"Category:Complex Number Problems\">Category:Complex Number Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Coordinate_Geometry_Problems\" title=\"Category:Coordinate Geometry Problems\">Category:Coordinate Geometry Problems</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding-left:10px;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Policies\">Policies</span></h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<p>In order to maintain an orderly wiki, the AoPS Wiki contains a set of general guidelines and policies that editors should always follow.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Policy\" title=\"Category:Policy\"><b>Policies</b></a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:What_AoPS_Wiki_is_not\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:What AoPS Wiki is not\">AoPS Wiki:What AoPS Wiki is not</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:NOT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:NOT\">A:NOT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Spam\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Spam\">AoPS Wiki:Spam</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:SPAM\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:SPAM\">A:SPAM</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Netiquette\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Netiquette\">AoPS Wiki:Netiquette</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:NET\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:NET\">A:NET</a></li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Category:Guideline\" title=\"Category:Guideline\"><b>Guidelines</b></a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Contest_Problem_Standards\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Contest Problem Standards\">AoPS Wiki:Contest Problem Standards</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:CPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:CPS\">A:CPS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Naming_conventions\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Naming conventions\">AoPS Wiki:Naming conventions</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:NAME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:NAME\">A:NAME</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding-left:10px;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;padding:10px;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Main_Page\" title=\"Main Page\">Main Page</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Tutorial\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Tutorial\">AoPS Wiki:Tutorial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:SpecialPages\" title=\"Special:SpecialPages\">Special:SpecialPages</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h4>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Contents\">Wikipedia Help</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Help:Contents\">MediaWiki Help</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017144143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 124/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1990/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 388/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 5/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.603      1 -total\n 62.52%   39.142      1 AoPS_Wiki:Requests\n 14.78%    9.252      4 Template:Hatnote\n 11.36%    7.110      1 Template:Shortcut\n 10.67%    6.681      3 Template:Main\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4844:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017144143 and revision id 252122. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}